    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 46.88,
      "end": 52.88,
      "en": "So, if your computer has a computer virus, it means your computer is sick, right?",
      "zh": "所以，如果你的电脑有电脑病毒，那就意味着你的电脑生病了，对吧？"
