      "zh": "在这个播客的结尾，你会明白一切。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 97.6,
      "end": 100.6,
      "en": "Perfect, let's listen.",
      "zh": "完美，让我们听。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 100.6,
      "end": 110.04,
      "en": "Oh great, the stupid computer froze again.",
      "zh": "真是的，这破电脑又死机了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 110.04,
      "end": 113.16,
      "en": "It's the third time today.",
      "zh": "这是今天第三次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 118.06,
      "end": 120.08,
      "en": "Hey Samuel, can you come take a look at my PC?",
      "zh": "嘿，塞缪尔，你能来看看我的电脑吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 120.7,
      "end": 121.48,
      "en": "It's acting up again.",
      "zh": "它又出毛病了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 121.76,
      "end": 122.76,
      "en": "It must have a virus or something.",
      "zh": "它八成是中了病毒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 123.9,
      "end": 125.24,
      "en": "Just give me a second, I'll be right up.",
      "zh": "等我一下，我马上上来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 136.21,
      "end": 140.33,
      "en": "I ran a virus scan on your computer and it turns out that you have a lot of infected files.",
      "zh": "我给你的电脑做了病毒扫描，发现有很多文件被感染了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 140.91,
      "end": 143.17,
      "en": "But I'm quite careful when I'm browsing the internet.",
      "zh": "但是当我浏览互联网时，我非常小心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 143.73,
      "end": 145.85,
      "en": "I have no idea how I could have picked up a virus.",
      "zh": "我完全不知道是怎么染上病毒的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 146.72,
      "end": 150.48,
      "en": "Well, you have to make sure their antivirus software is updated regularly.",
      "zh": "你得确保杀毒软件定期更新。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 151.24,
      "end": 152.14,
      "en": "Yours wasn't up to date.",
      "zh": "你的杀毒软件没有更新到最新版。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 152.44,
      "end": 154.08,
      "en": "That's probably what was causing your problems.",
      "zh": "这可能是导致您问题的原因。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 154.6,
